# [TEAS](../wg/teas.html)

## Summary

The Traffic Engineering Architecture and Signaling (TEAS) Working Group held its first session at IETF 127. The session covered working group document status updates, a discussion regarding rechartering the working group, updates on active WG documents, and presentations on service and network data model applicability for network slicing, ACTN Packet Optical Integration (POI) service assurance, and ACTN extensions for inter-operator coordination.

